kind: TaskDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Links one explicitly requested saved extracted event lead to an event candidate. Requires exact DiscoveryRunID and ExtractedLeadID. Never invent or substitute IDs.

  The lead must belong to the supplied run, have NEW status, and have no CandidateID. Its completed source retrieval and saved supporting excerpt must pass validation.

  Reuses one existing candidate with the same exact URL, or creates a provisional EVENT_LEAD candidate if no match exists. Multiple matches block linking. Exact-URL matching does not resolve cross-URL duplicates or establish event identity.

  Report success only for EXTRACTED_LEAD_LINKED. BLOCKED_LEAD_LINK may indicate an existing link or another failed readiness check; do not claim successful linking from that response.

  Do not retry automatically after an error or uncertain outcome. Inspect saved records first because candidate creation may have completed before linking failed.

  This tool does not execute searches, verify event facts, approve Gate 1, or confirm discovery completion.
outputs:
  - propertyName: extractedleadlinkresult

action:
  kind: InvokeFlowTaskAction
  flowId: 387d027f-dad1-f111-a05b-000d3a0aa2f5
  connectionProperties:
    $kind: ConnectionProperties
    diagnostics:
    mode: Invoker

outputMode: All